  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A haunting yet catchy tune lodges itself in the mind of one creature of your choice that you can see within range, repeating endlessly. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have Disadvantage on Intelligence checks and on Constitution saving throws made to maintain Concentration. It repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the spell on itself on a success.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 1.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-pVXlV4kBdkCgsYEN\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Delete the effect when the target succeeds on <em>Repeat Save</em>.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
